      "date": "2026-05-29T11:42:23.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹11.00 (vs ₹8.13 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹11.00 (up from ₹8.13 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.12b (up 28% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹53.5m (up 56% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.8% (up from 3.9% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 32% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 5% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
